So this is how my opponents feel...

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Into the Storm</h2> 
<i>"If I ever see a Man-O-War, I would just jump into the abyss."<br>
--Regular Nimbian Dude</i>
<p>As you advance onward, you are confronted by 4 mysterious islands.   You send out messages to them, but you prepare for battle just in case.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>Surviving the surge, you give yourself a pat on the back and advance onward, knowing that would lies beyond could be even more dangerous.
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b9

